entical character under strictly consistent scale and vertical baseline:\n  •Front view: A full‑length head‑to‑toe shot facing the camera in a relaxed natural standing posture\n  •Profile view: A strict 90‑degree pure‑side full‑body shot with a natural stance\n  •Rear view: A full‑body back‑angle shot showing the back of the head, torso and legs, matching the exact frame height and foot baseline of the other two views\n\nSeparate the left‑right panels with one thin transparent vertical divider. Add another two thin transparent vertical dividers between the three full‑body shots on the right. All transparent dividing lines are straight and evenly spaced for a minimalist, tidy layout.\n\nImplement unified professional studio lighting for the whole frame: soft directional key light, natural shadow depth and authentic light‑dark contrast. For the left‑side bust portrait: retain crisp eye details, original skin texture and accurate fabric rendering; excessive skin‑smoothing or airbrushing is forbidden. The three full‑body views on the right follow identical lighting logic with lifelike fabric draping, anatomically‑correct limb proportions and natural contour‑light falloff. Original hair texture is preserved in every perspective.\n\nThe subject’s facial features, facial proportions, hairstyle, physique, outfit and overall styling must strictly duplicate the reference image. The same textured gray studio backdrop is applied to all panels.\n\nText, watermarks, logos, subtitles, UI elements, borders, panel labels (A/B/C/1/2/3), angle notations, dimension lines and any other redundant elements are prohibited."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [408.3856506347656, 672.5322265625], "pos": [-1732.11279296875, 218.9276123046875], "id": 186, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 